.claude/
# Track only the glossary write-hook config and the worktree setup script;
# everything else under .claude/ (worktrees/, settings.local.json, ...) stays ignored.
# Node-first negation: re-include the directory node, re-exclude its contents,
# then re-include the two tracked files (a bare negation under an excluded dir is inert).
!.claude/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/setup-worktree.sh
.mcp.json
second-memory-tech-overview.pptx
AGENTS.md
.codex